XO Market PayBox plugin

This product includes the PayBox plugin starter (release 1.0.2) from MoonPay's PayBox
developer portal (https://developer.paybox.sh/plugin-starter/v1.0.2/): scripts/conformance.mjs,
scripts/process.mjs, scripts/report.mjs, scripts/schema.mjs, scripts/test.mjs, src/paybox.ts,
pnpm-workspace.yaml, starter-version.json, tsconfig.json and pnpm-lock.yaml (as the base of this
repository's lockfile). package.json, .gitignore, paybox-plugin.json and src/plugin.ts are derived
from the starter. The starter files are checked against the SHA-256 manifest published with the
release; this project claims no copyright over them.

The Cockpit page (app/) is built with React, TanStack Query, wouter, idb, viem and zod (MIT, ISC and Unlicense) and
tested with Vitest, jsdom, Playwright (Apache-2.0) and axe-core through @axe-core/playwright (MPL-2.0). The
test tools are development dependencies only: none of them is part of a built page. Licences and publish
dates of every direct dependency are recorded in app/scripts/dependencies.json.

The Cockpit page embeds two typefaces, served from the page's own origin and never fetched from a third party:
Archivo (copyright as stated in app/src/ui/fonts/OFL-Archivo.txt: Copyright 2020 The Archivo Project Authors)
and Martian Mono (copyright as stated in app/src/ui/fonts/OFL-MartianMono.txt: Copyright 2021 The Martian Mono
Project Authors), both under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The woff2 files under app/src/ui/fonts/ are
the unmodified static instances the upstream projects publish (Archivo Regular, Medium, SemiBold and Bold from the
Archivo repository's webfonts; Martian Mono Standard Regular and Medium from the Martian Mono 1.1.0 release), renamed
only; their embedded name and licence metadata are untouched. The licence texts sit beside them at the paths above;
the files as published declare no Reserved Font Name.
